DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/magic/cf1_sites/{cf1_site_id}
Deletes a specific CF1 Site for an account.
Required: account_id (path); cf1_site_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/magic/cf1_sites/{cf1_site_id}/ramps/{ramp_id}
Deletes a specific ramp from a CF1 Site.
Required: account_id (path); cf1_site_id (path); ramp_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/magic/cf1_sites/{cf1_site_id}
Gets a specific CF1 Site for an account.
Required: account_id (path); cf1_site_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/magic/cf1_sites/{cf1_site_id}/ramps/{ramp_id}
Gets a specific ramp for a CF1 Site.
Required: account_id (path); cf1_site_id (path); ramp_id (path)

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/magic/cf1_sites/{cf1_site_id}
Partially updates a specific CF1 Site for an account. Only the fields included in the request body are modified; omitted fields retain their existing values.
Required: account_id (path); cf1_site_id (path); body (body)
